cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it and the CUAD dataset it is built on."
type: dataset
title: "The Contract Folder Test: AeroSpark, Claude and ChatGPT Business on a folder of 99 CUAD contracts"
abstract: >-
  The same 46 plain-English questions about the same folder of 99 commercial contracts from CUAD, put to Claude Max (Opus 5.5 at High)
  and ChatGPT Business (GPT-6 at High), each reading the folder through its Google Drive connection, and to AeroSpark, a contract repository.
  Includes the questions, the answer key and how it was made, every system's answers as recorded, how each answer was read, and the
  code that scores them.
version: 1.0.0
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/AeroSpark-ai/contract-folder-benchmark"
keywords:
  - contracts
  - legal AI
  - benchmark
  - CUAD
  - ChatGPT
  - Claude
authors:
